  "title": "30 January 1967: Filming: Strawberry Fields Forever",
  "date": "1967-01-30",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Having decided that their next single would be the double a-side <a href=\"/songs/strawberry-fields-forever/\">‘Strawberry Fields Forever’</a> and <a href=\"/songs/penny-lane/\">‘Penny Lane’</a>, The Beatles took part in promotional films. Work began on this day in Knole Park in Sevenoaks, Kent. <span id=\"more-6145\"></span></p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe id=\"_ytid_78452\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\" data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"326\" data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HtUH9z_Oey8?enablejsapi=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;cc_load_policy=0&amp;cc_lang_pref=&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0&amp;fs=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;autohide=2&amp;theme=dark&amp;color=red&amp;controls=1&amp;disablekb=0&amp;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\" allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><p>The films were both produced by Tony Bramwell for Subafilms, and were shot on colour 35mm film by a crew from London-based Don Long Productions. The Swedish director was Peter Goldmann, who had been recommended by <a href=\"/people/klaus-voormann/\">Klaus Voormann</a>.</p><p>Goldmann had arrived in England in early January and looked for suitable locations in London and elsewhere. The first location he decided upon was Knole Park, owned by the National Trust.</p><p>On this evening filming began on Strawberry Fields Forever. A number of sequences were shot around a dead oak tree near the park’s birdhouse. The tree is no longer there.</p><p>Work on the Strawberry Fields Forever clip continued on <a href=\"/1967/01/31/filming-strawberry-fields-forever-2/\">the following day</a>.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/01/30/filming-strawberry-fields-forever/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-6145 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTMyIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzMiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"132\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-200x132.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-200x132.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-580x384.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-960x636.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-768x508.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"27123\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,662\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/m